{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "过了一天，感觉濑名比昨天对我更没有防备了。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要有这个烧卖的皮，不管包什么都能变成一道点心的感觉呢……”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1469", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，今天的特别课程是料理实习，主题是做烧卖。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“下次便宜的时候买来试看看好了。你不觉得点心风的便当很棒吗？”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1470", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只要里面不是放腌萝卜我就觉得不错。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不要再提了啦！腌萝卜早就吃完了！”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1471", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐呐，拜托了我们这组这样就好不要放豌豆……”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "sc0024", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系的，今天是要做道地风，而且我们组根本没拿到那个。”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1472", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“应该说没有才是正确的……啊啊～在那边吃到的时候完全没有放真是太好了。”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "sn0168", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，没有放的话色彩上确实有点寂寞。最初吃的时候还感觉很无趣呢。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1473", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理也常常去啊？”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "sn0169", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……以前啦，以前。突然被妈妈带走，等我发现的时候就上飞机了。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1474", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔……大小姐们聊出国经验聊得那么热络……”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "sc0025", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再顺带一提，分组早已经固定为最初的这些成员了。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这三人再加上我，手法不熟练地包着烧卖……", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，结束。那就立刻来蒸吧。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1475", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔！”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "sc0026", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，那边的混帐家伙。为什么拿两个蒸笼来？还有地瓜。”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "sn0170", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这是濑名叫我拿来的。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是为了加一道菜用的啦。地瓜正值产季，一起蒸起来吃吧。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1476", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔喔，大小姐果然很有风雅呢！”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "sc0027", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的，为什么爱理总是这么正经啊。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "sn0171", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然啦，只做一道就结束太不像话了……”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1477", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，就由我们来负责蒸吧。只让爱理一个人表现就太逊了。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "sn0172", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "sc0028", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们两人斗志高昂地开始摆放蒸笼──然后濑名笑着瞄了我一眼。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……其实啊。”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1478", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她靠到我身边小声说。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是因为我最喜欢吃蒸的东西了。”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1479", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、这样啊……”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我觉得一阵酥麻。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要保密喔。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1480", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，此时拉开距离的濑名露出笑容，完全没有注意到自己的行为有多么暧昧……", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好，那边交给纱凪她们，我们就负责处理这边的吧！”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1481", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔、嗯，好，开始动手吧。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还发生了这样的事。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呐，这跟昨天看的是相同的漫画吧？画风完全不同啊……”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1482", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这一点就只能当成常识接受了。长期连载的话，好像无论如何都会出现这种状况。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“漫画也有各种知识啊……对了瓜生。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1483", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个，不好意思打扰你们，瓜生君可以过来一下吗？”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "jc0033", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊……等我一下喔濑名。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我与濑名在聊漫画单行本的时候，班上同学突然来搭话。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，怎么了？”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个，刚才我擦了黑板，但是今天的值日生两个都是女孩子，所以上面……”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "jc0034", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，嗯，我知道了，我帮你们擦吧。毕竟踩椅子上去也不方便。”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你～”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "jc0035", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连一开始对男生的视线毫无防备的结女学生们，现在也恰到好处地在意起来了。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样一来男生们就不用穷紧张，对我个人来说很感激这样的变化。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我接过板擦，正要去擦黑板上方的部分时──", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……欸？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等等等、濑名！你要去哪里！？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我连忙擦干净黑板，追在濑名身后来到走廊。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……职员室。去问明天班会的事。冷静想想，现在不是看漫画的时候了。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1485", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我在聊到一半的时候去帮其他女生，所以濑名闹别扭了……？", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等一下等一下，那样的话我也去。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你去擦黑板啦。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1486", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“黑板已经擦好了。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就去帮其他女生的忙啊。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1487", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉。明明借漫画给濑名才是我第一个答应要帮的。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1488", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“去职员室吧？回来后再聊漫画的后续吧。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1489", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我还有很多不懂的地方喔。比如横跨两页的格子要怎么看之类的。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1490", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她终于点头，然后语速有点快地对我说。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，那种的话……”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有！去职员室确认完后，当然是要开始工作了。不会让你说擦黑板很忙所以没办法帮忙那种话喔！”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1491", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就～说～了～黑板已经擦好了啦～”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和她边走边开玩笑，我的内心不禁雀跃了起来。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那个濑名，居然也会做这种像吃醋的行为啊。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，时间来到放学。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拖得有点晚了呢。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“抱歉。今天工作的时候我聊太多废话了。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1492", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，就算是班级干部的工作，能边聊天边开心地做是最好的。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1493", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对吧，瓜生。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1494", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你愿意的话，要不要来我家一下？我觉得还聊不够呢。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1495", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……她这样约我。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，我不会拒绝。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尤其是她如此率直地邀约，就更不会了……", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“然后怎么了？结果气喘是什么时候治好的？”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "到了她家坐下后，濑名就开始很感兴趣地问我以前的事情。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想尽可能知道我的事情。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "清晰地感受到她的心意……我很高兴，但也有点难受。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、唔、嗯，抱歉抱歉。”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……其实等我注意到的时候就已经不再发作了。不过后遗症是到现在还对灰尘很敏感。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊……所以瓜生才会莫名对气氛很敏感啊。”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，最近对濑名以外的人都不怎么在意了……", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使如此，只有对她还是会想回答她的任何提问，有了喜欢的女孩后，男生变得真是滑稽呢。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，对家人也那么顾虑……我觉得樱乃应该完全不在意的。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，瓜生你的双亲一直没有回家吗？”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，从以前就是这种感觉……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，我继续回答她的问题。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我感觉得出来她希望我这么做。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这段时间，你一直都是跟樱乃两个人分担家务的吧？然后──”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越是回答她，她就越积极地继续抛出问题。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯──”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "简直就像……", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对找到的某个闪闪发光的东西着迷一般。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊！已经这么晚了！”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聊了好一会后，濑名突然注意到时间。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知不觉中，窗外的天色已经暗了。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……对了濑名，你是不是要打工？”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，就算现在出门也快迟到了……！欸～啊～欸……”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是备用钥匙！抱歉麻烦你锁门了！那我走了，明天见喔……！”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 377, "voice": "ar1504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她相当焦急，把钥匙放在我面前后就像风一样冲出家门了。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只剩我一个人留在濑名家里。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃……嗯。”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道她的个性正经，绝对不会允许自己迟到。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过她一定完全没有思考过现在的状况吧。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为女孩子的她，让男生的我一个人留在家里的危险性。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唔。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啊啊，可恶。我毕竟是男人啊。无论如何就是会涌出邪念。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随随便便就能翻找她私人物品的这个状况──", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唉。”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不要想、不要想。我提醒自己，然后离开濑名的家。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "锁上家门的钥匙，现在在我的口袋中。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘新吾同学好像哥哥一样呢！’", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 361, "voice": "ag0461", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想起安洁的话。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说的一点也没错，可是……", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……当‘哥哥’，实在很辛苦啊。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
